    "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <!-- Mobile responsive and other meta tags -->\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <meta name=\"mobile-web-app-capable\" content=\"no\" />\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <title>Regional Operation Manager</title>\n    <link rel=\"icon\" id=\"favicon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/images/favicon.png\"/>\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" /><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Regional Operation Manager - Career Page\" /><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"About Organization\n\n \n\nLetsTransport was founded in 2015 by IIT-Kharagpur alumni. It is a series-B\nfunded, last-mile tech-logistics solution provider for intra-state deliveries\nhead-quartered in Bangalore. It offers reliable, affordable, and professional\nservices, structured to serve enterprises. LetsTransport aggregates light\ncommercial vehicles for urban logistics and has onboarded 100,000+ truckers on\nits platform across 17 cities. LetsTransport works across industry sectors like\norganized retail, FMCG and e-commerce, distribution and 3PL companies. Some of\nits clients include Amazon, Britannia, Nestle, Bisleri, Vishal Mega Mart, JSW,\nACC, Coca-Cola, Delhivery, and Udaan. The company offers customized logistics\nsolutions for clients, along with other value-added services such as screened\ndrivers, audited and GPS-enabled vehicles, point-to-point billing, status\nupdates, 24x7 service, and greater efficiency, all at transparent and economical\npricing.\n\n \n\nAt LetsTransport, we have a singular mission to transform urban logistics in\nIndia through technology. We are backed by marquee investors like Bertelsmann,\nFosun, Mitsubishi, Rebright Partners and Mitsui Sumitomo Insurance Venture\nCapital.\n\n \n\nhttps://letstransport.in/ [https://letstransport.in/]\n\n \n\nDesignation – Regional Operations Manager – North India\n\nExperience – 4-8 Years\n\nJob Location – New Delhi (Will be responsible for whole North India for LT\nincluding Punjab, Delhi NCR, UP, Rajasthan, MP, Chhattisgarh)\n\n \n\nAbout the role\n\n \n\nThis role calls for an individual who can own all aspects of operations of a\nregion for Lets Transport.\n\nThe person should have high drive to meet targets and should be able to handle\nlarge geographical team effectively. Candidate will be working closely with\nRegional head and National Operations Manager towards creating a high performing\nteam which can deliver targets for a high growth company.\n\n \n\nRoles & Responsibilities:\n\n \n\n·      Responsible for all day to day operations for the region\n\n·      Work closely with Business development team and supply team to ensure the\nclient expectations are properly met by operations team\n\n·      Build and develop the required team to achieve the targets\n\n·      Drive operational efficiencies to maintain Service levels and expand\nmargins of the region.\n\n·      Build and implement processes to increase the overall efficiency and\nreliability of the region\n\n·      Participate in cross-functional projects for high priority initiatives\nand bring process and data-driven focused approach to support the organization's\ngoals.\n\n·      Drive change management to ensure efficient implementations of any new\nstrategic change.\n\n·      Collaborate closely with stakeholders like Finance, Product, Sales and\nNew initiatives with the objective to drive stakeholder success\n\n·      Ensure excellent customer and partner experience\n\nKPIs:\n\n·      Fulfilment rates for the region\n\n·      Margin for the region\n\n·      Internal Quality metrics – (SLAs %)\n\n·      Customer and Partner Success metrics – (Customer NPS, Partner NPS)\n\n·      Internal team productivity metrics (Operations cost per transaction)\n\n \n\nRequisites / Prerequisites:\n\n \n\n·      Graduates from Tier 1/2 Engineering colleges/Post Graduate from Tier 1/2\nManagement colleges with good academic performance.\n\n·      4-8 years of frontline Operation or P&L Management\n\n·      Strong leadership qualities to lead a large geographically spread team\n\n·      Ability to manage conflicts and good stakeholder management skills\n\n·      Multi-tasking capabilities and inter departmental coordination\n\n·      Product first mindset and relevant experience is a useful plus\n\n·      A strong team sport background is a plus (showcasing the long term\ncommitment and rigor).\n\n·      KPIs Handled: Delivery Fulfilment/ Service levels, cost related KPIs,\nRevenue growth and Margin KPIs, project management, Process or change management\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\nPreferred Industries: FMCG, Logistics, Hospitality, Mobility, Manufacturing,\nRetail, Ecommerce\n\n \" /><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://hire.auzmor.com/images/we_are_hiring.png\" /><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"200\" /><meta property=\"og:image-height\" content=\"200\" /><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://hire.auzmor.com/letstransport/careers/280260704c3e4d2ea7a578d94af51512\" /><meta property=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\" /><meta property=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Regional Operation Manager - Career Page\" /><meta property=\"twitter:description\" content=\"About Organization\n\n \n\nLetsTransport was founded in 2015 by IIT-Kharagpur alumni. It is a series-B\nfunded, last-mile tech-logistics solution provider for intra-state deliveries\nhead-quartered in Bangalore. It offers reliable, affordable, and professional\nservices, structured to serve enterprises. LetsTransport aggregates light\ncommercial vehicles for urban logistics and has onboarded 100,000+ truckers on\nits platform across 17 cities. LetsTransport works across industry sectors like\norganized retail, FMCG and e-commerce, distribution and 3PL companies. Some of\nits clients include Amazon, Britannia, Nestle, Bisleri, Vishal Mega Mart, JSW,\nACC, Coca-Cola, Delhivery, and Udaan. The company offers customized logistics\nsolutions for clients, along with other value-added services such as screened\ndrivers, audited and GPS-enabled vehicles, point-to-point billing, status\nupdates, 24x7 service, and greater efficiency, all at transparent and economical\npricing.\n\n \n\nAt LetsTransport, we have a singular mission to transform urban logistics in\nIndia through technology. We are backed by marquee investors like Bertelsmann,\nFosun, Mitsubishi, Rebright Partners and Mitsui Sumitomo Insurance Venture\nCapital.\n\n \n\nhttps://letstransport.in/ [https://letstransport.in/]\n\n \n\nDesignation – Regional Operations Manager – North India\n\nExperience – 4-8 Years\n\nJob Location – New Delhi (Will be responsible for whole North India for LT\nincluding Punjab, Delhi NCR, UP, Rajasthan, MP, Chhattisgarh)\n\n \n\nAbout the role\n\n \n\nThis role calls for an individual who can own all aspects of operations of a\nregion for Lets Transport.\n\nThe person should have high drive to meet targets and should be able to handle\nlarge geographical team effectively. Candidate will be working closely with\nRegional head and National Operations Manager towards creating a high performing\nteam which can deliver targets for a high growth company.\n\n \n\nRoles & Responsibilities:\n\n \n\n·      Responsible for all day to day operations for the region\n\n·      Work closely with Business development team and supply team to ensure the\nclient expectations are properly met by operations team\n\n·      Build and develop the required team to achieve the targets\n\n·      Drive operational efficiencies to maintain Service levels and expand\nmargins of the region.\n\n·      Build and implement processes to increase the overall efficiency and\nreliability of the region\n\n·      Participate in cross-functional projects for high priority initiatives\nand bring process and data-driven focused approach to support the organization's\ngoals.\n\n·      Drive change management to ensure efficient implementations of any new\nstrategic change.\n\n·      Collaborate closely with stakeholders like Finance, Product, Sales and\nNew initiatives with the objective to drive stakeholder success\n\n·      Ensure excellent customer and partner experience\n\nKPIs:\n\n·      Fulfilment rates for the region\n\n·      Margin for the region\n\n·      Internal Quality metrics – (SLAs %)\n\n·      Customer and Partner Success metrics – (Customer NPS, Partner NPS)\n\n·      Internal team productivity metrics (Operations cost per transaction)\n\n \n\nRequisites / Prerequisites:\n\n \n\n·      Graduates from Tier 1/2 Engineering colleges/Post Graduate from Tier 1/2\nManagement colleges with good academic performance.\n\n·      4-8 years of frontline Operation or P&L Management\n\n·      Strong leadership qualities to lead a large geographically spread team\n\n·      Ability to manage conflicts and good stakeholder management skills\n\n·      Multi-tasking capabilities and inter departmental coordination\n\n·      Product first mindset and relevant experience is a useful plus\n\n·      A strong team sport background is a plus (showcasing the long term\ncommitment and rigor).\n\n·      KPIs Handled: Delivery Fulfilment/ Service levels, cost related KPIs,\nRevenue growth and Margin KPIs, project management, Process or change management\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\nPreferred Industries: FMCG, Logistics, Hospitality, Mobility, Manufacturing,\nRetail, Ecommerce\n\n \" /><meta property=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://hire.auzmor.com/images/we_are_hiring.png\" /><meta property=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://hire.auzmor.com/letstransport/careers/280260704c3e4d2ea7a578d94af51512\" />\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"JobPosting\",\n  \"title\": \"Regional Operation Manager\",\n  \"description\": \"<p><strong style=\\\"color: black;\\\">About Organization</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\">LetsTransport was founded i